    <code code="18776-5" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Plan of care note"/>
    <title>Plan of Treatment</title>
    <text><list><item>Surgical oncology consultation for a suspected subungual melanoma, to plan staging and definitive surgery once the biopsy result is back. Guideline: NCCN Clinical Practice Guidelines in Oncology: Melanoma: Cutaneous, Version 3.2026 (2026); Swetter SM, et al. Guidelines of care for the management of primary cutaneous melanoma. J Am Acad Dermatol 2019;80(1):208-250 (2019) [S]</item><item>Dermoscopy of the nail and a full-thickness biopsy of the nail matrix at the origin of the band by the clinic&apos;s dermatologist within the week, with a full skin and nail examination including the palms and soles. Guideline: NCCN Clinical Practice Guidelines in Oncology: Melanoma: Cutaneous, Version 3.2026 (2026); Swetter SM, et al. Guidelines of care for the management of primary cutaneous melanoma. J Am Acad Dermatol 2019;80(1):208-250 (2019) [S]</item></list></text>

